# Cloudflare Pages / Workers — SPA fallback
#
# NOTE: the old catch-all rewrite `/*  /index.html  200` is intentionally
# removed. Cloudflare Workers static assets rejects it as an infinite loop
# (error code 100324): `/index.html` matches the `/*` glob, so the rewrite
# re-triggers on itself.
#
# Handle the SPA fallback the supported way instead:
#
#   • Cloudflare Workers (wrangler.toml):
#       [assets]
#       directory = "dist"
#       binding   = "ASSETS"
#       not_found_handling = "single-page-application"
#
#   • Cloudflare Pages: re-add the line below (Pages serves real files first,
#     so it does NOT loop there):
#       /*  /index.html  200
#
# Keep additional explicit redirects (non-catch-all) below this header.